This product includes third-party machine-learning models:

1. SFace face recognition model (face_recognition_sface_2021dec.onnx)
   Source: OpenCV Zoo, https://github.com/opencv/opencv_zoo/tree/main/models/face_recognition_sface
   Paper: Zhong et al., "SFace: Sigmoid-Constrained Hypersphere Loss for Robust Face Recognition", 2021
   License: Apache License 2.0 (tools/models/licenses/SFace-OpenCVZoo-LICENSE)
   Modifications: converted from ONNX to Core ML (tools/convert_sface.py).

2. MiniFASNetV2 and MiniFASNetV1SE anti-spoofing models
   Source: Minivision Silent-Face-Anti-Spoofing, https://github.com/minivision-ai/Silent-Face-Anti-Spoofing
   License: Apache License 2.0 (tools/models/licenses/SilentFace-LICENSE)
   Modifications: softmax appended and converted from PyTorch to Core ML (tools/convert_minifasnet.py).

The training datasets behind these models carry their own terms. See the upstream projects for details.
